# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
#  SECRETS — NEVER COMMIT THESE
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt
*.cer
# The one certificate file that belongs in the repository: Google's public attestation roots (ADR 0018).
# Public by design; every other *.pem stays ignored.
!users/attestation_roots.pem
service-account*.json
application_default_credentials.json
key.json
# Local review notes, kept out of the repository.
docs/review.md

